        "ID": "GravityCorerPiston",
        "Description": "A gravity corer using a piston. A heavily weighted core tube is dropped into the seabed. A piston inside the tube creates a vacuum that draws the unconsolidated sediment upward into the tube. Capable of collecting cores tens of meters in length.",
        "Code": "GravityCorerPiston",
        "AttributionAuthority": "OSDU",
        "AttributionRevision": "evergreen",
        "(COMPANY: insert comment)": "Proposal to NOT migrate \"Drop core\" as an alias. Research indicates that drop core is different from Piston core\n\nAppropriate updates have been made to the name and description.",
